		<Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_MER_MANNERHEIM_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Mannerheim</Text>
		</Row>
		<!--Traits-->
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_MER_OUR_HOMES_OUR_FAITH_OUR_COUNTRY_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Our Homes, Our Faith, and Our Country</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_MER_OUR_HOMES_OUR_FAITH_OUR_COUNTRY_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>All Military Units in friendly territory receive a bonus to [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength based on tile appeal, +3 in Average, +4 in Charming, and +5 in Breathtaking.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MODIFIER_MER_OUR_HOMES_OUR_FAITH_OUR_COUNTRY_AVERAGE_STRENGTH_DESC" Language="en_US">
			<Text>+3 [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength bonus from fighting on Average Appeal.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MODIFIER_MER_OUR_HOMES_OUR_FAITH_OUR_COUNTRY_CHARMING_STRENGTH_DESC" Language="en_US">
			<Text>+4 [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength bonus from fighting on Charming Appeal.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MODIFIER_MER_OUR_HOMES_OUR_FAITH_OUR_COUNTRY_BREATHTAKING_STRENGTH_DESC" Language="en_US">
			<Text>+5 [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength bonus from fighting on Charming Appeal.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_MER_KALEVALA_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Kalevala</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_MER_KALEVALA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Cities on the [ICON_Capital] Capital's continent receive +1 Loyalty per turn. Cities at maximum Loyalty receive an additional +10% [ICON_Culture] Culture and +10% [ICON_Production] Production. Unimproved Woods and Lake tiles yield +1 [ICON_Culture] Culture and +1 [ICON_Production] Production. </Text>
		</Row> 
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_MER_SISSI_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Sissi</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_MER_SISSI_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>A unique land unit</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MER_SISSI_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Sissi</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MER_SISSI_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Finnish unique unit replacing Infantry. 2x flanking bonus. Has a ranged attack with [ICON_Range] Range 1 and 75 [ICON_Ranged] Ranged Strength. Lower Melee Combat Strength (72 vs. 75). No strategic resource requirement.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_MER_SISSI_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Motti</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_MER_SISSI_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>2x flanking bonus.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_IMPROVEMENT_MER_SAUNA_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Sauna</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_IMPROVEMENT_MER_SAUNA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>A unique improvement</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_IMPROVEMENT_MER_SAUNA_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Sauna</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_IMPROVEMENT_MER_SAUNA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Finnish unique improvement. +1 Appeal and +0.5 [ICON_Housing] Housing. +1 [ICON_Culture] Culture and +1 [ICON_Production] Production. Additional +1 [ICON_Culture] Culture for every 2 adjacent Woods and +1 [ICON_Production] Production from adjacent Camps. +1 [ICON_Amenities] Amenity when adjacent to a river. Can be built on Grass, Plains, Tundra, Snow, Woods or Marsh, but not adjacent to another Sauna. Provides [ICON_Tourism] Tourism equal to the tile's Appeal after Flight.</Text>
		</Row>
